    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστενόω</span></b> , poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στεινόω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straiten,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				54
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα ἀπεστείνωτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.101
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος ἀπεστενωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.37
				</span></i>
			: metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be contracted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνῶσις ἀπεστενωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
				</span></i>
			<i>inPh.</i><i><span class="en">
				18.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχείρησις -μένη</span>”
				<i>hampered,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Top.</u>
					56.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τοῦ ἑνὸς ἀπεστενωμένον ἰδιασμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					28b
				</span></i>
			is.</div>
